<p>Alex is a Compliance Content Manager at Clym, where he researches and writes about everything related to data privacy and web accessibility compliance for businesses, helping them stay informed on their compliance needs and spreading awareness about making the web safer and more inclusive. When he&#39;s not writing about compliance, Alex has his nose in a book or is hiking in the great outdoors.</p>
